emaining - can't form pung\n2. It's an honor tile preventing \"No Honors\" pattern\n3. Doesn't contribute to any suit-based patterns\n4. My Seat Wind is West (F3), not North (F4), so no bonus value\n\nReason: F4 is the least useful tile as it cannot form any melds (only 1 remaining), blocks several scoring patterns like \"No Honors\" and \"All Simples\", and has no special value since it's not my Seat Wind or Prevailing Wind. Discarding it maintains my two concealed pungs (T3, T5) and keeps flexible Character tiles that might connect with my exposed W4-W5-W6 meld.\n\nAnswer: Play F4"}
